Markdown/CSV 与全部比较图；如需要 Word，先安装 python-docx 再执行本单元格。\n"]}],"source":["# 根据真实实验数值生成简短的分析摘要，避免在尚未训练时预设结论。\n","mean_mse_map = {d: results[d]['metrics']['test_mean_mse'] for d in LATENT_DIMS}\n","best_d = min(mean_mse_map,key=mean_mse_map.get)\n","base = mean_mse_map[2]\n","lines = [\n","    '# VAE 潜变量维度 2 / 4 / 8 对照实验结果（自动生成）',\n","    '',\n","    '## 实验协议',\n","    f'同一个 MNIST IDX 数据集，训练集 {len(train_dataset)} 张、测试集 {len(test_dataset)} 张；',\n","    f'全部使用 {EPOCHS} 个 Epoch、batch size={BATCH_SIZE}、Adam 学习率={LR}、KL 权重={KL_WEIGHT}、随机种子={SEED}。',\n","    '主评价量为测试集均值重建 MSE；随机重建 MSE 使用多次采样的平均。',\n","    '注意：由于网络末层和解码器输入随潜变量维度变化，参数量会发生小幅变化。',\n","    '',\n","    '## 测试集核心指标',\n","    '| 潜变量维度 | 参数量 | 均值重建 MSE | 随机重建 MSE | KL（各维求和） |',\n","    '|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|',\n","]\n","for d in LATENT_DIMS:\n","    s=results[d]['metrics']\n","    lines.append(f\"| {d} | {s['parameters']} | {s['test_mean_mse']:.6f} | \"\n","                 f\"{s['test_sample_mse_average']:.6f} | {s['test_mean_kl']:.4f} |\")\n","lines.extend([\n","    '',\n","    '## 当前数据支持的结论',\n","    f'- 以测试集均值重建 MSE 为指标，在本轮实验中 z={best_d} 的数值最低（{mean_mse_map[best_d]:.6f}），但这并不自动说明该维度的随机生成质量最好。',\n","    f'- z=4 相对于 z=2 的均值重建 MSE 变化为 {(mean_mse_map[4]-base):+.6f}；z=8 相对于 z=2 的变化为 {(mean_mse_map[8]-base):+.6f}。',\n","    '- 由于损失函数使用「各潜变量维度 KL 求和」，改变维度会改变 KL 的自然尺度，因此不能只用训练 total loss 判断优劣。',\n","    '- 应同时阅读 comparisons/ 下的逐类别 MSE、相同样本重建、固定先验采样和 KL 分维度统计。',\n","    '- 二维 VAE 使用原始潜变量坐标散点图；高维 VAE 使用 PCA 二维投影，投影坐标不具备直接的跨模型语义对应关系。',\n","    '- 高维模型的 latent slice 只是选取 KL 较大的两个维度、固定其余维度为 0 后的二维截面，不表示完整高维生成空间。',\n","    '',\n","    '## 报告写作提示',\n","    '建议按“实验设置 → 定量测试指标 → 同一组测试图片的重建对比 → 随机生成多样性 → 各维 KL → 原因分析与局限”撰写；',\n","    '不要把一次生成的图片清晰度等同于总体生成质量，也不要把二维 PCA 中类别重叠直接当作失败证据。',\n","])\n","(TABLE_DIR/'自动实验摘要.md').write_text('\\n'.join(lines),encoding='utf-8')\n","\n","try:\n","    from docx import Document\n","    from docx.shared import Pt, Inches\n","    from docx.oxml.ns import qn\n","    from docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH\n","\n","    report=Document()\n","    normal=report.styles['Normal']\n","    normal.font.name='Times New Roman'\n","    normal.font.size=Pt(12)\n","    normal._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn('w:eastAsia'),'宋体')\n","    normal._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn('w:ascii'),'Times New Roman')\n","    normal._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn('w:hAnsi'),'Times New Roman')\n","    normal.paragraph_format.line_spacing=1.5\n","    for name,size in [('Title',19),('Heading 1',15),('Heading 2',13)]:\n","        st=report.styles[name]\n","        st.font.name='Times New Roman'\n","        st.font.size=Pt(size)\n","        st._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn('w:eastAsia'),'宋体')\n","        st.paragraph_format.keep_with_next=True\n","    report.add_heading('VAE 潜变量维度 2、4、8 对照实验分析（自动初稿）',0)\n","    report.add_paragraph(f'实验条件：MNIST 训练集 {len(train_dataset)} 张，测试集 {len(test_dataset)} 张；'\n","                         f'{EPOCHS} 个 Epoch，batch size={BATCH_SIZE}，learning rate={LR}，'\n","                         f'KL weight={KL_WEIGHT}，seed={SEED}。')\n","    report.add_heading('一、模型与实验目标',level=1)\n","    report.add_paragraph('该实验在相同训练条件下比较潜变量维度为 2、4、8 的 VAE，'\n","                         '通过测试集均值重建误差、随机重建误差、分类别误差、潜空间可视化和 KL 散度，'\n","                         '检验增加潜变量维度是否改善当前二维 VAE 的重建能力与生成表现。')\n","    report.add_heading('二、目标函数与评价指标',level=1)\n","    report.add_paragraph('公式（1）：L = MSE(x, x_hat) + 0.001 × mean_x[Σ_j KL_j(x)]。'\n","                         ' 公式（2）：KL_j = 0.5 × [μ_j² + exp(logvar_j) − 1 − logvar_j]。'\n","                         ' 公式（3）：MSE_test = Σ_{images,pixels}(x − decode(μ(x)))² / 总像素数。')\n","    report.add_paragraph('公式均保留可复制的 LaTeX 书写说明：'\n","                         r'\\mathcal{L}=\\operatorname{MSE}+\\lambda_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\,\\mathbb{E}_x\\sum_j D_{\\mathrm{KL},j}  (1)；'\n","                         r'D_{\\mathrm{KL},j}=\\frac{1}{2}[\\mu_j^2+e^{\\ell_j}-1-\\ell_j]  (2)。')\n","    report.add_heading('三、总体对比结果',level=1)\n","    tab=report.add_table(rows=1,cols=5)\n","    tab.style='Table Grid'\n","    for c,h in zip(tab.rows[0].cells,['z 维度','参数量','测试均值 MSE','测试随机 MSE','测试 KL']):c.text=h\n","    for d in LATENT_DIMS:\n","        s=results[d]['metrics']\n","        row=tab.add_row().cells\n","        for c,v in zip(row,[str(d),str(s['parameters']),f\"{s['test_mean_mse']:.6f}\",\n","                            f\"{s['test_sample_mse_average']:.6f}\",f\"{s['test_mean_kl']:.4f}\"]):c.text=v\n","    report.add_paragraph(f'本次运行的最小测试集均值重建 MSE 来自 z={best_d} 模型，'\n","                         f'数值为 {mean_mse_map[best_d]:.6f}；该排序仅针对均值重建 MSE，'\n","                         '不能直接代表生成样本的清晰度或多样性。')\n","    # 纵向 10 行重建图太高，先把原始比较图分为两半以适合 A4 Word 排版。\n","    from PIL import Image as PILImage\n","    original_compare = PILImage.open(COMPARISON_DIR/'comparison_reconstruction_mean.png').convert('RGB')\n","    split_y = original_compare.height // 2\n","    for name, cropped in [\n","        ('0to4', original_compare.crop((0, 0, original_compare.width, split_y))),\n","        ('5to9', original_compare.crop((0, split_y, original_compare.width, original_compare.height))),\n","    ]:\n","        cropped.save(COMPARISON_DIR/f'comparison_reconstruction_mean_{name}.png')\n","    report.add_heading('四、相同测试图片的均值重建',level=1)\n","    for name in ('0to4','5to9'):\n","        report.add_picture(str(COMPARISON_DIR/f'comparison_reconstruction_mean_{name}.png'),width=Inches(5.1))\n","        report.add_paragraph(f'相同测试图片均值重建对比（部分 {name}）')\n","    report.add_paragraph('请对照原图观察不同维度模型是否更好地保留数字笔画结构。')\n","\n","    for title, fname in [\n","        ('五、十类数字 MSE','comparison_class_mse.png'),\n","        ('六、训练曲线','comparison_training_curves.png'),\n","        ('七、随机生成','comparison_prior_samples.png'),\n","        ('八、潜空间分布','comparison_latent_scatter.png'),\n","        ('九、KL 各维贡献','comparison_kl_by_dimension.png')\n","    ]:\n","        report.add_heading(title,level=1)\n","        report.add_picture(str(COMPARISON_DIR/fname),width=Inches(5.85))\n","        report.add_paragraph('本图应结合对应测试集数值与图像结构共同解释；单次可视化不代表所有生成样本的总体分布。')\n","    report.add_heading('十、结论与后续优化',level=1)\n","    report.add_paragraph(f'本次实验表明，z={best_d} 在完整测试集均值重建 MSE 指标上表现最佳。'\n","                         '潜变量维度对模型的重建能力与分布正则化产生了可测量的影响，但还应根据'\n","                         '相同测试图片的类别结构以及随机生成图像的丰富程度判断是否具有全面优势。'\n","                         '后续可进一步研究 KL 权重、网络宽度和训练轮数，且每次只改变一个主要因素。')\n","    docx_path=TABLE_DIR/'VAE_对照实验分析_自动初稿.docx'\n","    report.save(docx_path)\n","    print('Word 分析初稿:',docx_path)\n","except ImportError:\n","    print('当前环境没有 python-docx，已生成完整 Markdown/CSV 与全部比较图；如需要 Word，先安装 python-docx 再执行本单元格。')"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"aff61fc6","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.004966,"end_time":"2026-10-31T11:14:46.43446+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-31T11:14:46.429494+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 8. 一键归档：按原文件夹结构压缩所有模型、图、指标及报告"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":9,"id":"ae63622d","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-31T11:14:46.444449Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-31T11:14:46.444159Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-31T11:14:46.837644Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-31T11:14:46.83684Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.400589,"end_time":"2026-10-31T11:14:46.839469+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-31T11:14:46.43888+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["输出目录: /kaggle/working/hw2_results/vae_dim_comparison\n","已压缩归档: /kaggle/working/VAE_latent_2_4_8_results.zip\n","ZIP 包含 60 个文件，大小 8.03 MB\n","主要对比图: /kaggle/working/hw2_results/vae_dim_comparison/comparisons\n","指标 CSV / Word / Markdown: /kaggle/working/hw2_results/vae_dim_comparison/tables\n","Preview: comparison_test_mse.png\n"]},{"data":{"image/png":"\n","text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Image object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Preview: comparison_class_mse.png\n"]},{"data":{"image/png":"\n","text/plain":